{"availability":"available","full":"tbmattnz/ai-enquiry-crm","name":"ai-enquiry-crm","description":"Enquiry extraction, human review and CRM updates with safe retries. React + Node portfolio demo.","category":"Design","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-29T02:34:08Z","updated":"2026-09-29T02:38:08Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://tbmattnz.github.io/ai-enquiry-crm/","topics":["crm","human-in-the-loop","nodejs","portfolio","react"],"demo":"https://tbmattnz.github.io/ai-enquiry-crm/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T22:39:36.000Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T22:39:36.000Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T22:39:36.000Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T22:39:36.000Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Node.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Try the live demonstration · Two-minute walkthrough · About Matt Abraham","A small portfolio project by Matt Abraham, Product & Development Lead at Teacher's Buddy. It demonstrates the kind of focused integration I build: take an enquiry, propose structured details, let a person check them, then create or update a CRM record.","The public preview uses deterministic sample extraction and an in-memory sample CRM. It does not call an AI service. The local Node API also supports an optional Claude extraction adapter. Live provider calls have not been tested with a paid account; the adapter is covered by mocked response tests."],"features":["Separate extraction from approval. A plausible model response is not permission to write a record.","Validate on the backend too. Missing email, invalid field types and oversized input cannot bypass the UI.","Match email case-insensitively. A second enquiry from an existing contact updates the same record.","Save an approval receipt. A repeated request for the same draft returns the original result. Changed details cannot reuse an approved draft.","Demonstrate failure deliberately. The lost-response option simulates a write that succeeded before the response disappeared."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/tbmattnz/ai-enquiry-crm/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"695fe08d632a450178cc751fb5e56697cfb76a36a4ab5d2fc484fe49a03f231e","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T22:39:36.167Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T22:39:36.167Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Try the live demonstration · Two-minute walkthrough · About Matt Abraham","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/tbmattnz/ai-enquiry-crm/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"paid_service","status":"required","text":"No network services or paid credentials are required.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/tbmattnz/ai-enquiry-crm/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"paid_service","status":"required","text":"The default demo needs no subscription, external service or installation.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/tbmattnz/ai-enquiry-crm/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"695fe08d632a450178cc751fb5e56697cfb76a36a4ab5d2fc484fe49a03f231e","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/tbmattnz/ai-enquiry-crm/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T22:39:36.167Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-29T02:38:08Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/tbmattnz/ai-enquiry-crm/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T22:39:36.168Z","hash":"695fe08d632a450178cc751fb5e56697cfb76a36a4ab5d2fc484fe49a03f231e","originalBytes":7193,"storedBytes":7193,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["contact","enquiry","src","crm","extraction","local","demonstration","email","provider","response","anthropic","api","approval","draft","sample","adapter","docs","fields","key","live","model","npm","original","react","same","server","state","try","update","details","domain","http","human","log","mode","new","node","only","optional","record.","request","review","test","tests","text","uses","workflow","about","abraham","account","activity","adapter.","after","approved","authentication","been",